  "description": "An unwilling marriage, an unexpected love.\nYoung noblewoman Ariel Patrick has always dreamt of romance and passion. To her dismay, she is instead faced with a political marriage to the cold-hearted \"devil\" Duke Austin Alfred. Despite his rejection, can Ariel conquer the heart of a man who knows nothing but war and loyalty to the emperor?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
